## Notes
Executor, merger, scheduler and active-run lock implementations are absent in this checkout. `RepairPipeline` and `releaseActiveRun` are explicit integration boundaries; missing repair support terminates unresolved, never as a successful fix. Production repair execution, reviewer clarification sessions and live-provider/cross-platform checks remain unverified. The real Git/TDD demonstration uses an injected test pipeline.

