Do not equate an unavailable browser, missing account, or unreachable app with a passed criterion. Execute against the exact input SHA in a review-owned workspace and use approved setup. The functional reviewer may run browser/HTTP observations; it cannot edit command JSON or implement repairs.

**Naming and module boundaries:** TypeScript with named exports; keep SDK calls in `src/opencode/adapter.ts`, Git mutations in `src/git/`, approved commands in `src/process/`, and deterministic state transitions separate from agent prose.

